@startuml "Chain of Responsibility - Help (GoF) - Class Diagram"
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
title GoF's motivation — Design Patterns, pp. 223-232
abstract class HelpHandler <<Handler>> {
  - successor : HelpHandler
  - topic : String
  + hasHelp() : boolean
  + handleHelp() : String
}
abstract class Widget
class Button
class Dialog
class Application
HelpHandler <|-- Widget
Widget <|-- Button
Widget <|-- Dialog
HelpHandler <|-- Application
HelpHandler --> "0..1" HelpHandler : successor
note right of HelpHandler
  A widget's successor is its parent.
  A dialog's successor is the application.
end note
@enduml
